		"description": "Postman collection for the PH Healthcare System Backend.\n\nBase URL: http://localhost:5000\n\nAuthentication:\n- /auth/login, /auth/register-email-verify and /auth/google set the `accessToken` collection variable automatically (test script).\n- Every protected endpoint sends `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`.\n\nSeeded demo accounts (from .env):\n- Patient:  patient@gmail.com / Patient@123            (or register your own)\n- Admin:    testeradmin@gmail.com / Tester@admin1\n- Doctor:   testerdoctor@gmail.com / Tester@doctor1\n- SuperAdmin: superadmin@gmail.com / Super@admin1\n\nFlow order to exercise the whole system:\n1. Login/register a doctor, then POST /doctor/applying-as-doctor + verify email\n2. ADMIN: /doctor/approved-doctor\n3. DOCTOR: /schedule/create-schedules -> /schedule/publish-schedule/:scheduleId\n4. PATIENT: /appointment/book-appointment -> /appointment/pay-appointment -> bKash callback\n5. DOCTOR: /appointment/update-status/:appointmentId + /prescription/careate-prescription\n6. Browse: /analytics/*, /payment/*, /user/* etc.\n\nNote on route quirks found in the source:\n- The prescription create route has a typo `/careate-prescription` (kept to match the source).",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
